                "description": "PDQ 4200 Series  Grade 1 Polished Brass Touch Bar Rim Exit Device for doors 38 - 48 inches wide. A complete selection of exterior trim fuctions are available for these touch bar exit devices including keyed entry, passage, night latch, levers, knobs and handlesets.",
